# Pass/fail limits for tb_ELAD1_AGGRESSOR (flow: cells/<CELL>/sim/specs.txt).
# <name>  <min|->  <max|->   SI suffixes allowed. Typical-corner (tt, 27 C, 1.8 V) values in comments:
# "sim" = this testbench with the open_pdks sky130A models.
i_off        -     10n    # EN = 0: no current                                    sim 0.2 nA
i_inj        50u   130u   # AGG_CLK = 1: current steered into the tap             sim 74.6u
i_dum        50u   130u   # AGG_CLK = 0: same current through the dummy branch    sim 74.7u
i_step_pct   -5    5      # supply current change between the states (%)          sim -0.15
v_tap_step   40m   120m   # tap step into 800 ohm (substrate stand-in)            sim 59.7m
vx_max       -     0.6    # X stays low: the switches never both open             sim 0.098
